  journal article listed under preferred-citation.
type: software
title: "Motion-Induced Point Cloud Distortions in Mobile Laser Scanning: project page and distortion explorer"
version: 1.1.0
# TODO: set date-released to the day the v1.1.0 GitHub release is published (YYYY-MM-DD).
