abstract: >-
  Static project page for the study of motion-induced point cloud distortions
  in mobile laser scanning, with an interactive explorer that runs the
  closed-form distortion equations next to an independent top-view scan
  simulation, and field examples from a StreetMapper-V survey.
keywords:
  - mobile laser scanning
  - LiDAR
  - point cloud distortion
  - moving objects
  - layover
